  "description": "Lee Yoonsung and Park Dokyung grew up together in the countryside since they were young. Yoonsung became an actor by chance, but whenever he has time, he travels back and forth between Seoul and his hometown to see Dokyung, his first and unrequited love. \n\nDokyung cared for Yoonsung, who had cried a lot since he was young. Yoonsung finds himself developing stronger feelings for Dokyung, and his body's responses are becoming more noticeable. Fearing that his feelings would be exposed, Yoonsung tries not to show and resolves to remain at least a friend...\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
